{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_03",
  "title": "7:22P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0296997a39c3559fc61e614818f80844b0165c3f5cd7d4f0fccba821d2d17233",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我被击落了？从桥上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "离地面有多高？敌人从哪里发动的攻击？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不，比起那个，我现在应该——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "噗哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "得、得救了。这是......？呃，好黏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "是安魂夜的装饰蜡烛？谢天谢地，正好堆在这里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你角上也卡着一支喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃？谢、谢谢，得把这个拔下来，唔——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "蜡烛先生，先不要动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "安静，躲到箱子后面去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "弗伦佐的通讯断了，应该就在这附近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "企鹅物流也在这儿，发现目标立刻通知首领！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "可以出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊、好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "虽然很感谢你的帮助，但我不能把你卷进来，所以请快点离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我也想啊，难得回一趟龙门，但毕竟有委托嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看你这幅狼狈样，和企鹅物流打交道很辛苦吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......很辛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那么，你是谁？你不是普通的路人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "也不用这么紧张，总之，我不是你的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等等，他们又来了，先躲好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "娘咧，弗伦佐果然被企鹅物流抓到了。我们怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "那个叫拜松的丰蹄小子落单了，这是个大好机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "但这里已经是市区了，我们还能动手吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "卡彭先生都考虑过了，只要不动明火，做得隐秘一点，龙门是不会管的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "没有人会特地去关照那些散发着垃圾臭味的小街暗巷吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "明白了，那我们去救人，你们去找人，没问题吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看来这里已经不能久留了呢，我们得离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "让我看看......在那儿呢，打个招呼吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "老板，找到拜松了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "我戴的是墨镜，不是望远镜，别催我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊......看见了。在向我招手呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "那我们快去把他接回来吧，然后再来问问这个家伙，他们在打什么主意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "唔——唔唔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "看来我们幸运的实习生恰好摔在了一个安全的地方，他会自己回来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "嗯......从十二米高空自由落体到了一个安全的地方？怎么个安全法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "而且他也是敌人的目标之一喔，真的不管他吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "有她在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "......她回来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "能天使，别分神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "他们在那里！去把弗伦佐救回来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "哎呀，好像的确有点抽不开身呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "热热闹闹地走掉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "所以，德克萨斯他们又惹了什么麻烦？这次是和谁打架？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我该信任你吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "也是，自我介绍一下，我是企鹅物流的信使，莫斯提马。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "权且算是你的同行吧，不过我更喜欢自己行动多一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......莫斯提马，我在父亲那里听过这个名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（而且，长着漆黑双角的萨科塔......原来这个传闻是真的，不，还是不要问了吧......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "嗯......好事还是坏事呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不，怎么说，都是些不可思议的传闻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "而且你刚才帮了我，也许我不该怀疑你的，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "没关系的，你不用这么拘谨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "谢谢......总之，我们应该先共享一下情报......虽然我也是一头雾水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......简而言之，企鹅物流和一支叙拉古黑手党发生了矛盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "嗯，我大概明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "欸？这就明白了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "没必要顾虑那么多，适当地放弃思考，放纵本心，才能跟上企鹅物流的节奏喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃，原来诀窍是放弃思考吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "毕竟他们真的很特别，常识是不起作用的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......莫斯提马小姐也是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "一般会这么直接地问本人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "好、好像是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "总之，我们得先离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "跟我来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "喂！还没有发现目标吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "该死，这里人太多了，搞什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "走，我们去其它地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......他们好像没发现我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "就这样保持下去，然后想办法和德克萨斯他们汇合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "怎、怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "这个方向，前面的难道是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "被、被敌人发现了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "原来是这里，这么多年没有回过龙门，名字都换了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提马",
      "text": "嗯......你想不想吃点什么？我想想，抹茶还是巧克力？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
